    },
    "Voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting its turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Čeká, až na ni přijde řada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What its members share appears instead of what this family shares.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Místo toho, co sdílí tato rodina, uvidíte, co sdílejí členové té druhé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you add to the library is yours. Share a book from its menu; everyone in the family can then listen to it, each from their own position.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Co do knihovny přidáte, je vaše. Knihu sdílejte z její nabídky; pak si ji může poslechnout každý v rodině, každý od své vlastní pozice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who sees it": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kdo to uslyší"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole Library When Offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Celá knihovna offline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a code from that family's admin. You then leave this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S kódem od správce té rodiny. Z této pak odejdete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your own.audio account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S vaším účtem own.audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdraw": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zrušit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without http:// or https://, the app tries https and then http, so a server at home works as typed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bez http:// nebo https:// zkusí aplikace nejdřív https a pak http, takže domácí server funguje tak, jak ho napíšete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with own.audio and Audiobookshelf; the app finds out which. Your sign-in stays in this phone's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funguje s own.audio i Audiobookshelf; aplikace sama pozná, o který jde. Přihlášení zůstává v klíčence tohoto telefonu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written in": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Napsána v jazyce"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your audiobooks, from your own server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vaše audioknihy z vašeho vlastního serveru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-in stays in this iPhone's Keychain; both kinds of server hand out tokens, and the password is not kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Přihlášení zůstává v klíčence tohoto iPhonu; oba druhy serverů vydávají tokeny a heslo se neukládá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "another device": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "jiné zařízení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
